OL,3,GNEWSAPolice refers itself to watchdog
OL,4,Aover man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has referred itself to a
OL,7,Fwatchdog over the death of an
OL,8,F18-year-old man.
OL,10,FJames Corlett, from Swadlincote in
OL,11,FDerbyshire, was reported missing after
OL,12,Fhe did not return home following a
OL,13,Fnight out in Ashby-de-la-Zouch,
OL,14,FLeicestershire, on 29 October.
OL,16,FAn inquiry was launched by Derbyshire
OL,17,FPolice, before on Saturday it was
OL,18,Ftransferred to Leicestershire Police,
OL,19,Fwhich confirmed a body had been found
OL,20,Fin Ashby-de-la-Zouch and that Corlett's
OL,21,Fdeath was being "treated as
OL,22,Funexplained".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
