OL,3,GNEWSAPolice refers itself to watchdog
OL,4,Aover man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire Police said on Monday
OL,7,Fthat the death was not being treated as
OL,8,Fsuspicious, and has since confirmed it
OL,9,Fhad made a "mandatory referral" to the
OL,10,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,11,F(IOPC).
